WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.833
- First of all,

00:00:00.833 --> 00:00:03.600
do your kids ever wear your
jersey like on the mountain?

00:00:03.600 --> 00:00:05.016
- No, they don't.

00:00:05.016 --> 00:00:09.950
My kids, let's see my son
wears a Patrick Mahomes jersey

00:00:09.950 --> 00:00:14.130
and I think my daughter
wears a Stefon Diggs,

00:00:14.130 --> 00:00:15.823
Buffalo Bills jersey.

00:00:16.760 --> 00:00:17.840
It's very humbling.

00:00:17.840 --> 00:00:20.500
You know, having to ski
with a Chief's jersey

00:00:20.500 --> 00:00:21.333
right next to you.

00:00:21.333 --> 00:00:22.166
(Kelly laughing)

00:00:22.166 --> 00:00:23.370
But since I'm related to the kid,

00:00:23.370 --> 00:00:24.787
I feel like I have to do it.

00:00:24.787 --> 00:00:26.030
- Well, if it makes you feel any better,

00:00:26.030 --> 00:00:28.120
I am not my daughter's
favorite Voice coach.

00:00:28.120 --> 00:00:29.121
It's Nick Jonas.

00:00:29.121 --> 00:00:30.326
(Kelly laughing)

00:00:30.326 --> 00:00:31.159
- I like it. I like it.

00:00:31.159 --> 00:00:33.670
- She was asked and I was like, so rude.

00:00:33.670 --> 00:00:34.503
Okay.

